+
+### Account Rate Limits
+
+```properties
+botmail.rate-limit.enabled=true
+botmail.rate-limit.max-emails-per-account=100
+botmail.rate-limit.email-rate-window-hours=3
+botmail.rate-limit.max-registrations-per-ip=5
+botmail.rate-limit.max-failed-login-attempts=10
+botmail.rate-limit.failed-login-window-minutes=5
+botmail.rate-limit.ip-ban-duration-hours=3
+```
+
+### Inbound Volume Limits
+
+```properties
+botmail.rate-limit.inbound-enabled=true
+botmail.rate-limit.max-inbound-bytes-per-window=1048576000  # 1GB
+botmail.rate-limit.inbound-rate-window-hours=1
+botmail.rate-limit.min-free-disk-bytes=1073741824           # 1GB
+```
+
+---
+
+## 6. Fail2Ban SSH Integration
+
+`SshFail2BanService` monitors SSH authentication failures and feeds them into the cringe score system:
+
+```properties
+# Fail2Ban auto-configuration
+# Watches auth.log for SSH failures
+# Maps SSH brute-force IPs to cringe scores
+```
+
+This unifies SSH and SMTP abuse tracking under a single IP reputation system.
+
+---
+
+## 7. API Security
+
+### API Key Authentication
+
+```properties
+botmail.api-keys[0].key=<key>
+botmail.api-keys[0].label=admin
+botmail.api-keys[0].writeEnabled=true
+botmail.api-keys[0].readEnabled=true
+```
+
+The `NettyApiKeyFilter` validates API keys on every request. Keys can be read-only or read-write.
+
+### CORS
+
+```properties
+botmail.allowed-origins[0]=https://mail.lmyz.net
+```
+
+The `CorsFilter` enforces origin restrictions on the HTTP API.
+
+---
+
+## 8. TLS/SSL
+
+### Certificate Management
+
+```properties
+botmail.ssl.use-custom-certificate=true
+botmail.ssl.keystore-path=/var/lib/botmail/ssl/lmyz.net.pfx
+botmail.ssl.keystore-password=<password>
+botmail.ssl.verify-server-certificate=true
+```
+
+### SMTP STARTTLS
+
+Uses `netty-tcnative-boringssl-static` for native TLS performance:
+- Supports TLS 1.2 and 1.3
+- Modern cipher suites via `TlsCipherSuites`
+- Signature algorithm configuration via `NativeSslSigAlgs`
+
+### MTA-STS
+
+```properties
+botmail.smtp.mta-sts-enabled=true
+botmail.smtp.mta-sts-fetch-timeout-ms=10000
+```
+
+Enforces transport security based on recipient domain policies.
+
