+# Configuration Reference
+
+[← Back to Index](INDEX.md) | [← Security](07-security.md)
+
+## Overview
+
+LmyzMail is configured via `application.properties` (or equivalent YAML). The configuration file is organized into major sections. All properties use the prefix `botmail.*` except standard Spring Boot properties.
+
+---
+
+## Core Service
+
+```properties
+spring.main.web-application-type=none
+spring.threads.virtual.enabled=true
+
+# Database
+spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/botmail
+spring.datasource.username=botmail_user
+spring.datasource.password=<password>
+spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=validate
+spring.datasource.hikari.maximum-pool-size=400
+spring.datasource.hikari.minimum-idle=120
+
+# Redis
+spring.data.redis.host=localhost
+spring.data.redis.port=6379
+spring.data.redis.lettuce.pool.max-active=1000
+spring.data.redis.lettuce.pool.min-idle=300
+```
+
+---
+
+## Netty HTTP Server
+
+```properties
+botmail.netty.http.enabled=true
