+# LmyzMail Documentation
+
+> **Version:** 2.8.0  
+> **Java:** 22 (with Preview Features)  
+> **Framework:** Spring Boot 3.5.4  
+> **Build Tool:** Gradle  
+
+LmyzMail (codename "botmail") is a high-performance, feature-rich email server built on Netty with a unique blend of production-grade mail infrastructure and internet culture ("brainrot/shitpost") features. It runs a full SMTP stack, sends DMARC/TLS aggregate reports, integrates an XDP kernel firewall, a Minecraft 1.8.9 email client, an HTCPCP coffee/tea brewing protocol server, a multi-protocol honeypot, and AI-powered brainrot message generation — all in one Spring Boot application.
