+## Quick Feature Summary
+
+### Production Email Features
+- Full RFC-compliant SMTP server (STARTTLS, PIPELINING, CHUNKING/BDAT, 8BITMIME)
+- DKIM signing, SPF verification, DMARC policy enforcement
+- MTA-STS support
+- Outbound connection pooling (100 connections/host, 1500 msgs/connection)
+- PostgreSQL-backed mail queue with retry logic
+- Maildir-style storage with configurable limits
+- Redis-backed L2 DNS cache
+- DMARC and TLS-RPT aggregate report generation and delivery
+- Content-based spam filtering (rule pipeline with scoring)
+
+### Shitpost / Brainrot Features
+- **SkibidiInferX LM**: Custom 22M parameter transformer trained on brainrot text, generates unique SMTP rejection messages using SIMD-accelerated native inference
+- **Skibidi Generator**: AVX2/AVX-512 optimized native C library for generating random "Skibidi dop dop" expressions at microsecond latency
+- **Brainrot Quiz**: In-SMTP-session quiz game (`SKIBIDITOILET` command) with 10 difficulty levels
+- **ASCII Art Video Streaming**: Real-time video→ASCII transcoding over SMTP (plays Skibidi Toilet Episode 1)
+- **Path Scan Trolling**: Returns fake credentials/configs filled with brainrot to vulnerability scanners
+- **Honeypot Mockery**: Detects 20+ protocols and responds with custom insults per protocol
+
+### Exotic Protocol Servers
+- **Minecraft 1.8.9 Server**: Full protocol 47 implementation — authenticate, compose, send emails in-game with chest GUI, book & quill editor, video map walls
+- **HTCPCP Server**: RFC 2324 + RFC 7168 compliant coffee/tea brewing protocol with 8 pots
+
+### Security Infrastructure
+- **XDP Firewall**: eBPF kernel-level packet filtering (millions of PPS)
+- **Cringe Score System**: Per-IP reputation with automatic escalation to XDP bans
+- **Multi-protocol Honeypot**: Detects SSH, FTP, MySQL, Redis, VNC, RDP, Minecraft, etc.
+- **Spamhaus DNSBL integration**
+- **Tarpitting** with exponential backoff
+- **Fail2Ban SSH integration**
